<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net buyers of Japanese stocks in week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers of Japanese stocks in week.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of Japanese stocks on the Tokyo, Osaka and Nagoya stock exchanges in the week of March 31 to April 4, exchange data showed.</p>
<p>Foreign investors have been net buyers for nine weeks.</p>
<p>The figures, which are rounded, are as follows:</p>
<p>    Total foreign buying	   501.20 billion yen</p>
<p>    Total foreign selling	  471.98 billion yen</p>
<p>    Net buying			  29.22 billion yen</p>
<p>    Previous week net buying     131.76 billion yen</p>
